  *         on either groups regular or injected.
  * @rmtoll OFR1     OFFSET1_CH     LL_ADC_SetOffset\n
  *         OFR1     OFFSET1        LL_ADC_SetOffset\n
  *         OFR1     OFFSET1_EN     LL_ADC_SetOffset\n
  *         OFR2     OFFSET2_CH     LL_ADC_SetOffset\n
