  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL_15_REG          (0)
  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL_15_INJ          (0)
  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL_15_REG_INJ
  *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL_16_REG          (0)
