  * @note   The HAL_IRDA_UnRegisterCallback() may be called before HAL_IRDA_Init() in HAL_IRDA_STATE_RESET
  *         to un-register callbacks for HAL_IRDA_MSPINIT_CB_ID and HAL_IRDA_MSPDEINIT_CB_ID
  * @param  hirda irda handle
